            "block_content": "44-5-6 Teachers shall be placed on the twenty-fifth (25th) step of the salary schedule after twenty-four (24) years in the teaching profession, fifteen (15) of which must have been in the Jefferson County Public Schools. Teachers who entered the District with more than five (5) years of experience will notify the Human Resources division when they are eligible for placement on the twenty-fifth (25th) step.",
