        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "44-6-4 Level 4 is a regular license valid for teaching assignments and sixty (60) semester hours of credit earned after the date the bachelor's degree was awarded, including a master's degree. (At least one-half (1/2) of the sixty (60) hours must be graduate credit.)",
